.TH LIBMPQ__UPDATE_BEGIN 3 2026-09-25 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__update_begin \- begin a filesystem MPQ update transaction
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__update_begin(mpq_update_s **update, const char *path);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a same-directory private working copy of an existing regular MPQ at \fIpath\fP. The original file is unchanged until commit. On failure, \fI*update\fP is NULL. MPQE and embedded MPQs are not accepted. The handle is consumed by commit or abort.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns \fBLIBMPQ_SUCCESS\fP on success, or a negative libmpq error.
.SH ERRORS
Invalid paths, unsupported formats, allocation, and backing I/O errors are returned as negative LIBMPQ_ERROR_* values.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__update_commit (3),
.BR libmpq__update_abort (3)
